        "original_id": "913f31f9-6888-52cf-aebf-1752a87d9d41",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Dean Jones, John Indi, Laurens van der Post\n- Films: The Million Dollar Duck, A Far Off Place, The Love Bug, Beethoven, Incident at Victoria Falls, Mandela\n- Companies: Walt Disney Productions\n- Roles: Jim Douglas, Albert Dooley, Dr. Herman Varnick\n- Topics: film adaptations, actor filmography\n\nFacts:\n- The Million Dollar Duck, also titled The $1,000,000 Duck, is a 1971 American comedy film produced by Walt Disney Productions about a goose that lays golden eggs.\n- Dean Jones played Albert Dooley in The Million Dollar Duck (1971) and received a Golden Globe nomination for that role.\n- Laurens van der Post wrote A Story Like the Wind in 1972 and A Far-Off Place in 1974.\n- John Indi appeared in Incident at Victoria Falls in 1992.\n- Beethoven is a 1992 film in which Dean Jones played Dr. Herman Varnick.\n- A Far Off Place is a 1993 American adventure drama film based on Laurens van der Post's works A Far-Off Place and its prequel A Story Like the Wind.\n- John Indi is known for roles in A Far Off Place (1993) and Mandela.\n- Dean Jones played Jim Douglas in The Love Bug (1968).",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
      {
        "id": 1,
        "original_id": "b4b6cd5a-4560-5e41-b5d7-f2062afebee6",
        "text": "Page: The Million Dollar Duck. Sentence: The Million Dollar Duck (also titled as The $1,000,000 Duck) is a 1971 American comedy film produced by Walt Disney Productions about a goose that lays golden eggs scenario.\nPage: A Far Off Place. Sentence: A Far Off Place is a 1993 American adventure drama film based on Laurens van der Post's works \"A Far-Off Place\" (1974) and its prequel \"A Story Like the Wind\" (1972).\nPage: Dean Jones (actor). Sentence: \" (1965), Jim Douglas in \"The Love Bug\" (1968), Albert Dooley in \"The Million Dollar Duck\" (1971; for which he received a Golden Globe nomination) and Dr. Herman Varnick in \"Beethoven\" (1992).\nPage: John Indi. Sentence: John Indi is an actor known for his roles in \"A Far Off Place\" (1993), \"Mandela\", and \"Incident at Victoria Falls\" (1992).",
